# Tor bridge torrc for WF defense experiments.
#
# Used by the wfbridge0 host added by generate-wf-config.py when
# --defense tamaraw is in effect. The bridge terminates the Tamaraw
# pluggable-transport link from each monitor, then forwards plain
# Tor cells onward into the rest of the simulated network.
#
# This file is included via torrc-defaults; tor.common.torrc supplies
# the shared bits (DataDirectory ., Log, AssumeReachable, etc.).

ORPort 9001 IPv4Only
DirPort 0
SocksPort 0
BridgeRelay 1
PublishServerDescriptor 0
ExitPolicy "reject *:*"
ExtORPort auto

ServerTransportListenAddr tamaraw 0.0.0.0:34000
ServerTransportPlugin tamaraw exec /home/projectadmin/obfs4proxy_tamaraw
ServerTransportOptions tamaraw rho-client=12 rho-server=4 nseg=200
